{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42158","headline":"赋得霍将军辞第 · 徐铉","name":"赋得霍将军辞第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉将承恩久，图勳肯顾私。\n匈奴犹未灭，安用以家爲。\n郢匠虽闻诏，衡门竟不移。\n宁烦张老颂，无待晏婴辞。\n甲乙人徒费，亲邻我自持。\n悠悠千载下，常作帅臣师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}